TC
 
## 	{SA TC1i} 	{SB TC1c} 	{SC TC1n} 	{SD TC1t} 	 
1.	uyartiṇai ~eṉmaṉār makkaḷ+ cuṭṭu* ē 
2.	~aḵṟiṇai ~eṉmaṉār avar ala piṟa ~ē 
3.	~āy iru tiṇaiyiṉ icaikkumaṉa col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC2i} 	{SB TC2c} 	{SC TC2n} 	{SD TC2t} 	 
1.	āṭūu ~aṟi col% makaṭūu ~aṟi col+ 
2.	pallōr aṟiyum^ colloṭu civaṇi 
3.	~a+ mu+ pāl+ col uyartiṇaiyav= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC3i} 	{SB TC3c} 	{SC TC3n} 	{SD TC3t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu* aṟi col= ē pala ~aṟi col= eṉṟu* 
2.	āy iru pāl+ col aḵṟiṇaiyav= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC4i} 	{SB TC4c} 	{SC TC4n} 	{SD TC4t} 	 
1.	peṇmai cuṭṭiya ~uyartiṇai maruṅkiṉ 
2.	āṇmai tirinta peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi ~um^ 
3.	teyvam^ cuṭṭiya peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi ~um 
4.	iv= eṉa ~aṟiyum antam^ tamakku* ila ~ē 
5.	~uyartiṇai maruṅkiṉ+ pāl pirintu* icaikkum. 

 
## 	{SA TC5i} 	{SB TC5c} 	{SC TC5n} 	{SD TC5t} 	 
1.	ṉaḵkāṉ oṟṟu* ē ~āṭūu ~aṟi col. 

 
## 	{SA TC6i} 	{SB TC6c} 	{SC TC6n} 	{SD TC6t} 	 
1.	ḷaḵkāṉ oṟṟu* ē makaṭūu ~aṟi col. 

 
## 	{SA TC7i} 	{SB TC7c} 	{SC TC7n} 	{SD TC7t} 	 
1.	raḵkāṉ oṟṟu* um pakara ~iṟuti ~um* 
2.	mārai+ kiḷavi ~uḷa#paṭa mūṉṟu 
3.	nēra+ tōṉṟum palar aṟi col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC8i} 	{SB TC8c} 	{SC TC8n} 	{SD TC8t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu* aṟi kiḷavi ta ṟa ṭa ~ūrnta 
2.	kuṉṟu* iyal ukarattu* iṟuti ~ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TC9i} 	{SB TC9c} 	{SC TC9n} 	{SD TC9t} 	 
1.	a ā va eṉa varūum iṟuti 
2.	~a+ pāl% mūṉṟu* ē pala ~aṟi col= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC10i} 	{SB TC10c} 	{SC TC10n} 	{SD TC10t} 	 
1.	iru tiṇai maruṅkiṉ aim pāl aṟiya 
2.	~īṟṟiṉ* niṉṟu* icaikkum patiṉōr eḻuttu* um^ 
3.	tōṟṟam^ tām ē viṉaiyoṭu varum ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC11i} 	{SB TC11c} 	{SC TC11n} 	{SD TC11t} 	 
1.	viṉaiyiṉ+ ^tōṉṟum pāl aṟi kiḷavi ~um 
2.	peyariṉ+ ^tōṉṟum pāl aṟi kiḷavi ~um* 
3.	mayaṅkal kūṭā tam marapiṉa ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC12i} 	{SB TC12c} 	{SC TC12n} 	{SD TC12t} 	 
1.	āṇmai tirinta peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi 
2.	~āṇmai ~aṟi coṟku* āku* iṭaṉ iṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC13i} 	{SB TC13c} 	{SC TC13n} 	{SD TC13t} 	 
1.	ceppu* um viṉā ~um vaḻāal ōmpal. 

 
## 	{SA TC14i} 	{SB TC14c} 	{SC TC14n} 	{SD TC14t} 	 
1.	viṉā ~um^ ceppu* ē viṉā ~etir variṉ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC15i} 	{SB TC15c} 	{SC TC15n} 	{SD TC15t} 	 
1.	ceppu* ē vaḻīiyiṉ-um varai-nilai ~iṉṟu* ē 
2.	~a+ poruḷ puṇarnta kiḷaviyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC16i} 	{SB TC16c} 	{SC TC16n} 	{SD TC16t} 	 
1.	ceppiṉ um viṉāviṉ um^ ciṉai mutal+ kiḷavikku* 
2.	a+ poruḷ ākum uṟaḻ tuṇai+ poruḷ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC17i} 	{SB TC17c} 	{SC TC17n} 	{SD TC17t} 	 
1.	takuti ~um vaḻakku* um^ taḻīiyiṉa ~oḻukum 
2.	pakuti+ kiḷavi varai-nilai ~ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC18i} 	{SB TC18c} 	{SC TC18n} 	{SD TC18t} 	 
1.	iṉam+ cuṭṭu* illā+ paṇpu koḷ peyar+ koṭai 
2.	vaḻakku* āṟu* alla ceyyuḷ āṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC19i} 	{SB TC19c} 	{SC TC19n} 	{SD TC19t} 	 
1.	iyaṟkai+ poruḷai ~iṟṟu* eṉa+ kiḷattal. 

 
## 	{SA TC20i} 	{SB TC20c} 	{SC TC20n} 	{SD TC20t} 	 
1.	ceyaṟkai+ poruḷai ~ākkamoṭu kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC21i} 	{SB TC21c} 	{SC TC21n} 	{SD TC21t} 	 
1.	ākkam^ tāṉ ē kāraṇam* mutaṟṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC22i} 	{SB TC22c} 	{SC TC22n} 	{SD TC22t} 	 
1.	ākkam+ kiḷavi kāraṇam iṉṟi ~um 
2.	pōkku* iṉṟu* eṉpa vaḻakkiṉ uḷ= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC23i} 	{SB TC23c} 	{SC TC23n} 	{SD TC23t} 	 
1.	pāl% mayakku* uṟṟa ~aiyam+ kiḷavi 
2.	tāṉ aṟi poruḷ vayiṉ+ paṉmai kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC24i} 	{SB TC24c} 	{SC TC24n} 	{SD TC24t} 	 
1.	urupu* eṉa moḻiyiṉ-um aḵṟiṇai+ pirippiṉ -um 
2.	iru vīṟṟu* -um urittu* -ē cuṭṭum^ kālai. 

 
## 	{SA TC25i} 	{SB TC25c} 	{SC TC25n} 	{SD TC25t} 	 
1.	taṉmai cuṭṭal um urittu* eṉa moḻipa 
2.	~aṉmai+ kiḷavi vēṟu* iṭattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC26i} 	{SB TC26c} 	{SC TC26n} 	{SD TC26t} 	 
1.	aṭai ciṉai mutal eṉa muṟai mūṉṟu* um* mayaṅkāmai 
2.	naṭai-peṟṟu* iyalum vaṇṇam+ ciṉai+ col. 

 
## 	{SA TC27i} 	{SB TC27c} 	{SC TC27n} 	{SD TC27t} 	 
1.	oruvarai+ kūṟum paṉmai+ kiḷavi ~um 
2.	oṉṟaṉai+ kūṟum paṉmai+ kiḷavi ~um 
3.	vaḻakkiṉ ākiya ~uyar-col+ kiḷavi 
4.	~ilakkaṇam* maruṅkiṉ+ col= āṟu* alla. 

 
## 	{SA TC28i} 	{SB TC28c} 	{SC TC28n} 	{SD TC28t} 	 
1.	celaviṉ um varaviṉ um^ taraviṉ um^ koṭaiyiṉ um* 
2.	nilaipeṟa+ tōṉṟum a+ nāl+ col= um^ 
3.	taṉmai muṉṉilai paṭarkkai ~eṉṉum 
4.	a+ mū ~iṭattu* um uriya ~eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TC29i} 	{SB TC29c} 	{SC TC29n} 	{SD TC28t_&&} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	taru col varu col= āy iru kiḷavi ~um^ 
3.	taṉmai muṉṉilai ~āy īr iṭatta. 

 
## 	{SA TC30i} 	{SB TC30c} 	{SC TC30n} 	{SD TC28t_&&} 	 
1.	ēṉai ~iraṇṭu* um ēṉai ~iṭatta. 

 
## 	{SA TC31i} 	{SB TC31c} 	{SC TC31n} 	{SD TC29t} 	 
1.	yātu* evaṉ eṉṉum āy iru kiḷavi ~um 
2.	aṟiyā+ poruḷ vayiṉ+ ceṟiya+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC32i} 	{SB TC32c} 	{SC TC32n} 	{SD TC30t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	yātu* eṉa varūum viṉāviṉ kiḷavi 
3.	~aṟinta poruḷ vayiṉ aiyam^ tīrtaṟku+ 
4.	terinta kiḷavi ~ātal um urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC33i} 	{SB TC33c} 	{SC TC33n} 	{SD TC31t} 	 
1.	iṉaittu* eṉa ~aṟinta ciṉai mutal+ kiḷavikku 
2.	viṉai+ paṭu tokutiyiṉ ummai vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TC34i} 	{SB TC34c} 	{SC TC34n} 	{SD TC32t} 	 
1.	maṉṉā+ poruḷ um aṉṉa ~iyaṟṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC35i} 	{SB TC35c} 	{SC TC35n} 	{SD TC33t} 	 
1.	e+ poruḷ āyiṉ-um allatu* il= eṉiṉ 
2.	a+ poruḷ allā+ piṟitu poruḷ kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC36i} 	{SB TC36c} 	{SC TC36n} 	{SD TC34t} 	 
1.	a+ poruḷ kūṟiṉ+ cuṭṭi+ kūṟal. 

 
## 	{SA TC37i} 	{SB TC37c} 	{SC TC37n} 	{SD TC35t} 	 
1.	poruḷoṭu puṇarā+ cuṭṭu+ peyar āyiṉ-um 
2.	poruḷ vēṟupaṭāatu* oṉṟu* ākum= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC38i} 	{SB TC38c} 	{SC TC38n} 	{SD TC36t} 	 
1.	iyal#peyar kiḷavi ~um^ cuṭṭu+ peyar+ kiḷavi ~um 
2.	viṉaikku* oruṅku* iyalum^ kālam^ tōṉṟiṉ+ 
3.	cuṭṭu+ peyar+ kiḷavi muṟpaṭa+ kiḷavār 
4.	iyal#peyar vaḻiya ~eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TC39i} 	{SB TC39c} 	{SC TC39n} 	{SD TC37t} 	 
1.	muṟpaṭa+ kiḷattal ceyyuḷ uḷ urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC40i} 	{SB TC40c} 	{SC TC40n} 	{SD TC38t} 	 
1.	cuṭṭu mutal ākiya kāraṇam+ kiḷavi ~um^ 
2.	cuṭṭu+ peyar iyaṟkaiyiṉ+ ceṟiya+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC41i} 	{SB TC41c} 	{SC TC41n} 	{SD TC39t} 	 
1.	ciṟappiṉ ākiya peyar-nilai+ kiḷavikku* um 
