## 	{SA TC42i} 	{SB TC42c} 	{SC TC42n} 	{SD TC40t} 	 
1.	oru poruḷ kuṟitta vēṟu peyar+ kiḷavi 
2.	toḻil vēṟu kiḷappiṉ oṉṟu* iṭaṉ ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC43i} 	{SB TC43c} 	{SC TC43n} 	{SD TC41t} 	 
1.	taṉmai+ col= ē ~aḵṟiṇai+ kiḷavi ~eṉṟu* 
2.	eṇṇu-vaḻi maruṅkiṉ viravutal varaiyār. 

 
## 	{SA TC44i} 	{SB TC44c} 	{SC TC44n} 	{SD TC42t} 	 
1.	orumai ~eṇṇiṉ potu+ piri pāl+ col= 
2.	orumaikku* allatu* eṇṇu muṟai nillātu. 

 
## 	{SA TC45i} 	{SB TC45c} 	{SC TC45n} 	{SD TC43t} 	 
1.	viyaṅkōḷ eṇṇu+ peyar tiṇai viravu varaiyār. 

 
## 	{SA TC46i} 	{SB TC46c} 	{SC TC46n} 	{SD TC44t} 	 
1.	vēṟu viṉai+ potu+ col oru viṉai kiḷavār. 

 
## 	{SA TC47i} 	{SB TC47c} 	{SC TC47n} 	{SD TC45t} 	 
1.	eṇṇum^ kāl um atu ~ataṉ marapu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC48i} 	{SB TC48c} 	{SC TC48n} 	{SD TC46t} 	 
1.	iraṭṭai+ kiḷavi ~iraṭṭiṉ+ pirintu* icaiyā. 

 
## 	{SA TC49i} 	{SB TC49c} 	{SC TC49n} 	{SD TC47t} 	 
1.	oru peyar+ potu+ col uḷ poruḷ oḻiya+ 
2.	teripu vēṟu kiḷattal* ^talaimai ~um paṉmai ~um 
3.	uyartiṇai maruṅkiṉ um aḵṟiṇai maruṅkiṉ um. 

 
## 	{SA TC50i} 	{SB TC50c} 	{SC TC50n} 	{SD TC48t} 	 
1.	peyariṉ um^ toḻiliṉ um piripavai ~ellām^ 
2.	mayaṅkal kūṭā vaḻakku vaḻi+ paṭṭaṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC51i} 	{SB TC51c} 	{SC TC51n} 	{SD TC49t} 	 
1.	pala vayiṉāṉ um eṇṇu+ tiṇai viravu+ peyar 
2.	aḵṟiṇai muṭipiṉa ceyyuḷ uḷ= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC52i} 	{SB TC52c} 	{SC TC52n} 	{SD TC50t} 	 
1.	viṉai vēṟu-paṭūum pala-poruḷ-oru-col 
2.	viṉai vēṟu-paṭāa+ pala-poruḷ-oru-col= eṉṟu* 
3.	āy iru vakaiya pala-poruḷ-oru-col. 

 
## 	{SA TC53i} 	{SB TC53c} 	{SC TC53n} 	{SD TC51t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	viṉai vēṟu-paṭūum pala-poruḷ-oru-col 
3.	vēṟu-paṭu viṉaiyiṉ um iṉattiṉ um^ cārpiṉ um^ 
4.	tēṟa+ tōṉṟum poruḷ* ^teri nilai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC54i} 	{SB TC54c} 	{SC TC54n} 	{SD TC52t} 	 
1.	oṉṟu viṉai maruṅkiṉ oṉṟi+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TC55i} 	{SB TC54c_&&} 	{SC TC55n} 	{SD TC53t} 	 
1.	viṉai vēṟupaṭāa+ pala-poruḷ-oru-col% 
2.	^niṉaiyum^ kālai+ kiḷantāṅku* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TC56i} 	{SB TC55c} 	{SC TC56n} 	{SD TC54t} 	 
1.	kuṟittōṉ kūṟṟam^ terittu moḻi kiḷavi. 

 
## 	{SA TC57i} 	{SB TC56c} 	{SC TC57n} 	{SD TC55t} 	 
1.	kuṭimai ~āṇmai ~iḷamai mūppu* ē 
2.	~aṭimai vaṉmai viruntu* ē kuḻu ~ē 
3.	peṇmai ~aracu* ē maka ~ē kuḻavi 
4.	taṉmai tiri peyar uṟuppiṉ kiḷavi 
5.	kātal ciṟappu* ē ceṟal+ col viṟal+ col eṉṟu* 
6.	ā ~aṟu mūṉṟu* um uḷa#paṭa+ tokaii 
7.	~aṉṉa piṟa ~um avaṟṟoṭu civaṇi 
8.	muṉṉattiṉ uṇarum^ kiḷavi ~ellām 
9.	uyartiṇai maruṅkiṉ* ^nilaiyiṉa ~āyiṉ um 
10.	aḵṟiṇai maruṅkiṉ+ kiḷantāṅku* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TC58i} 	{SB TC57c} 	{SC TC58n} 	{SD TC56t} 	 
1.	kālam ulakam uyir ē ~uṭampu* ē 
2.	pāl varai teyvam viṉai ~ē pūtam* 
3.	ñāyiṟu tiṅkaḷ col= eṉa varūum 
4.	āy īr aintoṭu piṟa ~um aṉṉa 
5.	~ā vayiṉ varūum^ kiḷavi ~ellām 
6.	pāl pirintu* icaiyā ~uyartiṇai mēṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC59i} 	{SB TC58c} 	{SC TC59n} 	{SD TC57t} 	 
1.	niṉṟāṅku* icaittal ivaṇ iyalpu* iṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC60i} 	{SB TC59c} 	{SC TC60n} 	{SD TC58t} 	 
1.	icaittal um uriya vēṟu* iṭattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC61i} 	{SB TC60c} 	{SC TC61n} 	{SD TC59t} 	 
1.	eṭutta moḻi ~iṉam^ ceppal um urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC62i} 	{SB TC61c} 	{SC TC62n} 	{SD TC60t} 	 
1.	kaṇ= um^ tōḷ um* mulai ~um piṟa ~um 
2.	paṉmai cuṭṭiya ciṉai-nilai+ kiḷavi 
3.	paṉmai kūṟum^ kaṭappāṭu* ila ~ē 
4.	tam viṉaikku* iyalum eḻuttu* alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC63i} 	{SB TC62c} 	{SC TC63n} 	{SD TC61t} 	 
1.	vēṟṟumai tām ē ~ēḻ eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TC64i} 	{SB TC63c} 	{SC TC64n} 	{SD TC61t_&&} 	 
1.	viḷi koḷvataṉ-kaṇ viḷiyōṭu* eṭṭu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC65i} 	{SB TC64c} 	{SC TC65n} 	{SD TC62t} 	 
1.	avai tām peyar ai oṭu ku 
2.	iṉ atu kaṇ viḷi ~eṉṉum īṟṟa. 

 
## 	{SA TC66i} 	{SB TC65c} 	{SC TC66n} 	{SD TC63t} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* uḷ 
2.	eḻuvāy vēṟṟumai peyar tōṉṟu nilai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC67i} 	{SB TC66c} 	{SC TC67n} 	{SD TC64t} 	 
1.	poruṇmai cuṭṭal viyaṅkōḷ varutal 
2.	viṉai-nilai ~uraittal viṉāviṟku* ēṟṟal 
3.	paṇpu koḷa varutal peyar koḷa varutal eṉṟu* 
4.	aṉṟi ~aṉaittu* um peyar+ payaṉilai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC68i} 	{SB TC67c} 	{SC TC68n} 	{SD TC65t} 	 
1.	peyariṉ ākiya tokai ~um ār uḷa ~ē 
2.	~av= um uriya ~a+ pālāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC69i} 	{SB TC68c} 	{SC TC69n} 	{SD TC66t} 	 
