## 	{SA TC70i} 	{SB TC69c} 	{SC TC70n} 	{SD TC67t} 	 
1.	kūṟiya muṟaiyiṉ urupu nilai tiriyātu* 
2.	īṟu peyarkku* ākum iyaṟkaiya ~eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TC71i} 	{SB TC70c} 	{SC TC71n} 	{SD TC68t} 	 
1.	peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi kālam^ tōṉṟā 
2.	toḻiṉilai ~oṭṭum oṉṟu* alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC72i} 	{SB TC71c} 	{SC TC72n} 	{SD TC69t} 	 
1.	iraṇṭu* ākuvatu* ē 
2.	ai ~eṉa+ peyariya vēṟṟumai+ kiḷavi 
3.	~ev vaḻi variṉ-um viṉai ~ē viṉai+ kuṟippu* 
4.	av= iru mutaliṉ+ ^tōṉṟum atu ~ē. 

 
{SA TC72i_&&} 	{SB TC72c} 	{SC TC73n} 	{SD TC70t} 	 
1.	kāppiṉ oppiṉ ūrtiyiṉ iḻaiyiṉ 
2.	ōppiṉ+ pukaḻiṉ+ paḻiyiṉ eṉṟā 
3.	peṟaliṉ iḻaviṉ+ kātaliṉ vekuḷiyiṉ+ 
4.	ceṟaliṉ uvattaliṉ+ kaṟpiṉ eṉṟā 
5.	~aṟuttaliṉ+ kuṟaittaliṉ+ ^tokuttaliṉ+ pirittaliṉ* 
6.	^niṟuttaliṉ aḷaviṉ eṇṇiṉ eṉṟā 
