1.	viṉai ~eñcu kiḷavi ~um vēṟu pal kuṟiya. 

 
## 	{SA TC451i} 	{SB TC458c} 	{SC TC458n} 	{SD TC448t} 	 
1.	urai ~iṭattu* iyalum uṭaṉilai ~aṟital. 

 
## 	{SA TC452i} 	{SB TC459c} 	{SC TC459n} 	{SD TC449t} 	 
1.	muṉṉattiṉ uṇarum^ kiḷavi ~um uḷa ~ē 
2.	~iṉṉa ~eṉṉum^ col% muṟaiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TC453i} 	{SB TC460c} 	{SC TC460n} 	{SD TC450t} 	 
1.	oru poruḷ iru col+ pirivu* ila varaiyār. 

 
## 	{SA TC454i} 	{SB TC461c} 	{SC TC461n} 	{SD TC451t} 	 
1.	orumai cuṭṭiya peyar-nilai+ kiḷavi 
2.	paṉmaikku* ākum iṭaṉ um ār uṇṭu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TC455i} 	{SB TC462c} 	{SC TC462n} 	{SD TC452t} 	 
1.	muṉṉilai cuṭṭiya ~orumai+ kiḷavi 
2.	paṉmaiyoṭu muṭiyiṉ-um varainilai ~iṉṟu* ē 
3.	~āṟṟuppaṭai maruṅkiṉ+ pōṟṟal vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TC456i} 	{SB TC463c} 	{SC TC463n} 	{SD TC453t} 	 
1.	ceyyuḷ% maruṅkiṉ um vaḻakk-iyal% maruṅkiṉ um* 
2.	mey-peṟa+ kiḷanta kiḷavi ~ellām 
3.	pal vēṟu ceytiyiṉ* ^nūl* ^neṟi piḻaiyātu 
4.	col varaintu* aṟiya+ pirittaṉar kāṭṭal 
